# 🌑 AETHERIA — THE WORLD AFTER THE END

> **The world has already ended.
> Your journey is not to prevent its destruction, but to earn the right to create it again.**

Aetheria is a **Fantasy RPG World Simulation Project** set after the destruction of the original world by **Nythar, the Dark God**.

The player takes the role of **The Master**, chosen by the **Game Master System** to climb a mysterious 100-floor tower, gather survivors from the fallen world, uncover the truth behind the destruction, and ultimately challenge Nythar.

If the Master reaches **Floor 100** and defeats the Dark God, the ancient pact will be fulfilled and the world may be reborn.

---

## 🌍 WORLD OVERVIEW

Aetheria was once a vast fantasy world inhabited by many different races and civilizations.

The world contained numerous kingdoms, cultures, religions, guilds, magical academies, and ancient civilizations.

### Major Races

* Human
* Elf
* High Elf
* Dark Elf
* Dwarf
* Beastfolk
* Orc
* Dragonkin
* Demon
* Halfling
* Gnome
* Fairy
* Merfolk
* Lizardfolk
* Giant
* Undead
* And many other minor races

Each race possesses its own:

* Culture
* Territory
* Government
* History
* Religion
* Technology
* Social structure
* Relationship with other races

### Important Principle

> **No race is inherently evil.**

Humans can become heroes or villains.

Demons can become heroes or villains.

Orcs can become merchants, warriors, or scholars.

Elves can become protectors, adventurers, or enemies.

The alignment of a character is determined by their **choices, beliefs, faction, and circumstances**, not simply their race.

