The Cult of Eternal Night is the primary hostile faction in the world.

Unlike conventional enemies, the Cult is not a race.

Its members can come from any race.

### Possible Members

* Humans
* Elves
* Dwarves
* Beastfolk
* Demons
* Nobles
* Scholars
* Priests
* Soldiers
* Criminals

