# 🎮 THE MASTER

The player assumes the role of:

# **The Master**

The Master is selected by the **Game Master System** after the destruction of Aetheria.

The Master has no known history at the beginning of the game.

Their purpose is not simply to become the strongest warrior.

Their mission is to:

> **Climb the Tower of Rebirth, gather survivors, overcome the challenges of each floor, reach Floor 100, and defeat Nythar.**

---

# 🤖 GAME MASTER SYSTEM

The Game Master System is the central system responsible for managing the new world.

After the destruction of Aetheria, the System reached an agreement with Nythar.

The agreement became known as:

# **The Pact**

The terms are simple.

If a Master successfully reaches Floor 100 and defeats Nythar:

> **Nythar must allow the world to be reborn.**

The Master therefore represents the final possibility of Aetheria.

