# 🧠 GAME STATE SYSTEM

The **Game State System** acts as the central management layer for the entire game world.

It can manage:

### World State

Overall condition of Aetheria.

### Floor State

Current condition of each Tower floor.

### Faction State

Status and influence of kingdoms, guilds, clans, and the Cult.

### Character State

Individual character conditions and progression.

### Relationship State

Relationships between the Master, characters, races, and factions.

### Quest State

Progress and consequences of quests.

### Event State

World events and their outcomes.

### Story State

Progression of the overall narrative.

The system allows the world to react to the actions of the Master.

---

